            <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="3467-0678-083e-eb50">This operative can use frag and krak grenades (see universal equipment). Doing so doesn’t count towards any limited uses you have (i.e. if you also select those grenades from equipment for other operatives). Whenever it’s doing so, improve the Hit stat of that weapon by 1.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Explosive Demise" id="695e-d950-8c0c-6aca" hidden="false" typeId="f887-5881-0e6d-755c" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="3467-0678-083e-eb50">If this operative is incapacitated, before it&apos;s removed from the killzone, roll two D6, or one D6 if this operative is within control range of an enemy operative. If any result is a 4+, inflict D3+2 damage on each operative visible to and within 2&quot; of this operative. If this operative hasn’t used its diabolyk bomb during the battle, inflict D6+2 damage instead.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <selectionEntries>
        <selectionEntry name="Diabolyk bomb" id="f868-5702-33ef-bce4" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
