              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Equipment" typeId="0e12-ef21-83f3-9fc6">Whenever an enemy operative is shooting against, fighting against or retaliating against a friendly BLOODED operative that has one of your Blooded tokens and is within 2&quot; of it, your opponent cannot re-roll their attack dice results of 1.</characteristic>
